[I] Make Image - a command line screenshot utility

[T] maim (make image) takes screenshots of your desktop. It is a rewrite of
[T] scrot with improved compositing support and better region selection via
[T] slop. Commonly bound to the print key in lightweight window managers.

[U] https://github.com/naelstrof/maim

[A] Dalton Nell <naelstrof@gmail.com>
[M] Dennie Mahne <dennie.mahne@gmail.com>

[C] extra/x11

[L] GPL
[V] 5.8.2

